=== GATE ===

--- GATE BUG DETECTED ---
The gate as written in prompt 0010 contains a PowerShell parameter incompatibility:
  Get-Content $proto -TotalCount 5 -Raw
PowerShell rejects -Raw and -TotalCount together (cannot be specified in the same command),
so $head becomes $null and $null -notmatch 'pattern' is $true, falsely triggering BLOCKED.
Substantive evidence the proto IS proto3 (Get-Content -TotalCount 3 without -Raw):
syntax = "proto3";

package telemetry.vehicle_data;
Re-running the gate with one minimal correction: Get-Content $proto -TotalCount 5 joined with newlines.
All other gate logic preserved verbatim. Per Honesty Covenant the corrected gate's EXIT/STATUS is authoritative.

